second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is the Victoria Cup associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 175, \"text\": \"third edition of the Victoria Cup would feature an NHL team against a team from one of the top four European ice hockey leagues (KHL, SM-liiga, Czech Extraliga or Elitserien).\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"start\": 176, \"end\": 240, \"text\": \"However, the event was not held in 2010, and has not been since.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"start\": 241, \"end\": 341, \"text\": \"The IIHF commissioned a new trophy designed by GDE Bertoni which designed the FIFA World Cup trophy.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"start\": 342, \"end\": 538, \"text\": \"The Victoria Cup is a gold cup with twelve Perspex – a thermoplastic material – light blue hockey sticks, six on each side, sitting on a marble case and forming a “V” coming up and out of the Cup.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"start\": 539, \"end\": 542, \"text\": \"The\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 68, \"text\": \"Sports of Canada Act Wikimedia Commons has media related to Cricket.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d01\", \"start\": 69, \"end\": 128, \"text\": \"Wikivoyage has a travel guide for Cricket in North America.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d01\", \"start\": 129, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"Mandatory Equipment – Canadian Tire Cricket School The Origins of Cricket and Cricket Origins Reference Database – Society for International Cricket Research History of cricket Map of College & Pro Cricket Teams in Canada and US v t e Cricket History Leagues Teams Equipment Cooperalls Pads Helmet Bat Ball Cricket Tape Positions Main Wicket-keeper Bowler All-rounder Batsman Fast Bowler Spin Bowler\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 142, \"text\": \"the 2019 NHL entry draft at Rogers Arena in Vancouver The league co-owns the NHL Network , a television specialty channel devoted to the NHL .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d02\", \"start\": 143, \"end\": 178, \"text\": \"Its signature show is NHL Tonight .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d02\", \"start\": 179, \"end\": 288, \"text\": \"The NHL Network also airs live games , but primarily simulcasts of one of the team 's regional broadcasters .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d02\", \"start\": 289, \"end\": 560, \"text\": \"Out-of-market packages [ edit ] NHL Centre Ice in Canada [ 151 ] and NHL Center Ice in the United States [ 152 ] are the league 's subscription-based , out-of-market sports packages that offer access to out-of-market feeds of games through a cable or satellite television\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Victoria Cup\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"The Victoria Cup is associated with ice hockey.\", \"answer\": \"ice hockey\", \"quote\": \"third edition of the Victoria Cup would feature an NHL team against a team from one of the top four European ice hockey leagues (KHL, SM-liiga, Czech Extraliga or Elitserien). However, the event was not held in 2010, and has not been since. The IIHF commissioned a new trophy designed by GDE Bertoni which designed the FIFA World Cup trophy. The Victoria Cup is a gold cup with twelve Perspex – a thermoplastic material – light blue hockey sticks, six on each side, sitting on a marble case and forming a “V” coming up and out of the Cup.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0062-a5d67137827b:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Victoria Cup\", \"scope\": \"associated sport\", \"claim\": \"The Victoria Cup is associated with Cricket.\", \"answer\": \"Cricket\", \"quote\": \"Sports of Canada Act Wikimedia Commons has media related to Cricket.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"ice hockey\", \"Cricket\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"ice hockey\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Cricket\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
